          SIZE 12 BY 1
          BGCOLOR 15 FGCOLOR 9 FONT 6 NO-TAB-STOP 
     v-Pendiente AT ROW 1.48 COL 50.4 COLON-ALIGNED WIDGET-ID 4 NO-TAB-STOP 
     Btadic AT ROW 1.52 COL 116 WIDGET-ID 90 NO-TAB-STOP 
